    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Countryside Legends \u2014 a game that invites you to enjoy laid-back racing in a stunningly beautiful countryside world. This isn\u2019t about adrenaline or stress \u2014 it\u2019s about relaxation, scenic tracks, and unique cars, each with its own distinct personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against AI opponents, travel through green fields, sunny hills, and quiet villages. Immerse yourself in a world where every race is a pleasure, not a challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 6 unique cars: each with its own driving style and design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scenic tracks: from quiet forest paths to sunlit fields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Relaxing atmosphere: soothing music and a charming art style help you unwind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- AI racing: friendly competitors who won\u2019t stress you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Freedom of play: join races or explore tracks at your own pace.</p>",
